      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving understandability.The test class has a single `@Test` method (`test_adjust1`) buried among many unused data-provider methods and excessive imports. I'll produce a focused version with only what's needed.Now I'll compile-check the generated test.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version removes all unused data-provider methods and excessive imports, introduces a named constant `ST_TIBS_DAY` with an explanatory comment, and adds a class-level Javadoc and inline comment that clearly communicate why `lastDayOfMonth()` on St. Tib's Day is an identity operation."
